    "extract": "CKAU-FM is a French language First Nations community radio station that operates at 104.5 FM in Maliotenam, Quebec. A rebroadcaster at 90.1 FM, CKAU-FM-1, serves the adjacent communities of Sept-Îles and Uashat.",
    "extract_html": "<p><b>CKAU-FM</b> is a French language First Nations community radio station that operates at 104.5 FM in Maliotenam, Quebec. A rebroadcaster at 90.1 FM, CKAU-FM-1, serves the adjacent communities of Sept-Îles and Uashat.</p>"
